cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, these inputs or this code, please cite the article below."
title: "FragFlow: depth-resolved cosolvent mapping in lipid bilayers -- data, simulation inputs and figure code"
abstract: >-
  Source data, simulation input sets and figure code for FragFlow, a cosolvent molecular dynamics
  method that scores probe density against a depth-resolved reference measured in the same box
  rather than against a single scalar bulk density. Covers three membrane proteins in POPC: the
  ADP/ATP carrier, C5a receptor 1 and TREK-1.
